WEBVTT

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.280
Wow.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:14.110
I didn't know you were here 
to repair the bridge, Kartatz.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:18.100
I just figured I'd have to 
carry everyone back over again.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.450
You're a lifesaver.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.370
Thanks!

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:26.850
I heard that the bandit boss was captured 
and things were safe around here again,

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:29.300
so they hired me to rebuild the bridge.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.290
Stop patting me on the head! I'm not a kid!

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.060
For crying out loud...

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:38.630
And to take care of the rest of the bandits,

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.190
the knights from Felskeilo and Helshper

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.980
are joining forces to 
create a special task force.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.390
Huh.

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:47.730
And that bandit boss...

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.190
Did you do the deed?

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:51.110
Huh? Whatever do you mean?

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:56.660
I know you're the one who defeated him,
 so I'm assuming you finished him off.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:01.240
I didn't want to cause any trouble 
with Helshper, so I handed him over.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:07.320
I see. I guess I'll ask Sis what 
kind of punishment the guy got.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.090
Oh, that reminds me.

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:14.510
Once I get back to Felskeilo, 
I need to punish Mai-Mai myself.

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:18.560
Godspeed, Sis.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.430
But you know...

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:23.020
Caerick and Caerina were both great kids.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:26.190
<i>Now she's doting on her grandkids.</i>

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>What the heck happened?</i>

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:05.950
<b>Bear Hunting, a Queen, a Bath, and Monsters</b>

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:05.950
<b>Bear Hunting, a Queen, a Bath, and Monsters</b>

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:13.580
Lady Cayna, we were able to safely 
return to Felskeilo thanks to you.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:15.730
Here's the sum we agreed on.

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:17.880
Thank you so much again.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.390
Likewise.

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:22.700
I feel much better now!

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.800
Are you gonna be doing more 
adventurer work, missy?

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.220
That's my plan.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:31.480
I see! Well, if you ever feel like it,
 come see the Flame Spears again!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.740
We'll welcome you with open arms!

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:38.650
We'd have no problem taking you on as our 
caravan's exclusive bodyguard, you know.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.650
We would pay you handsomely, of course!

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:44.550
Well, let's remember that for next time.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.410
If you'll excuse me.

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.080
Well, then...

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:57.860
I don't have anything planned, so I guess 
I'll head over to the Adventurers' Guild.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:01.420
Let's see if there are 
any interesting quests.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:07.120
As usual, the board's 
overflowing with quests.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.250
The world sure is full of trouble.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:18.910
Eeny, meeny, miny, moe... 
Catch a tiger by the toe.

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:22.240
I... choose... you!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:26.450
Acquisition of the ingredient 
horned bear meat.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.660
The client is The White-Tailed Black Rabbit?

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:34.520
"White-Tailed"? I could swear 
I've heard that somewhere before.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:39.670
<i>It's the high-end restaurant where Skargo, 
Mai-Mai, and Kartatz eat together.</i>

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:40.920
Aha!

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.260
This one it is!

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:46.370
I'd like to take on this quest.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.010
Sure, no problem.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.430
The quest is all yours.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.970
Alrighty, I'm gonna go 
hunt some horned bears.

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:56.770
Take care.

00:04:58.820 --> 00:04:59.940
Oh, sorry.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.580
Oh, no, I wasn't paying attention myself.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.980
That's the girl who walked across the river.

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:10.280
Could that technique actually be...
 Nah, that can't be possible.

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:13.170
Oh, Miss Cayna!

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.720
Hey, Lonti! It's been a while!

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:19.730
P-Perfect timing.

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:20.500
It is?

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:25.920
Y-Yes. Well... I wanted to ask 
a favor of you, Miss Cayna.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.910
F-First, allow me to do some introductions.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:40.060
This is a fellow classmate 
at the Academy, and my friend.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:43.090
Um... Th-This is Mye.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:47.700
My name is Mye. It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.340
Aw, you're so polite. I'm the high elf, Cayna.

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.450
So what's this request?

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:56.160
I-I'm terribly sorry, Miss Cayna,

00:05:56.160 --> 00:06:00.730
but would you permit us to 
accompany you for a while?!

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:01.920
Huh?

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:07.130
Um... Sure, I guess?

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:10.380
Really? Thank you very much!

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.770
Isn't that great?

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:12.710
Yes.

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.560
I don't mind...

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:17.350
But could you tell me what's going on?

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:21.350
Er, yes. You see, um... The thing is...

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:28.200
Lonti wanted to find someone reliable 
who could be my bodyguard.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:35.050
Your bodyguard? I still don't really get it. 
Is she a runaway or something?

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:38.230
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:42.620
Lonti is just accompanying me.
 This was all my idea.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:43.190
So—

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:44.340
Okay, hold your horses.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:48.450
I'm not sure why you're panicking,

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:52.260
but I'm not going to 
report you two to anyone.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:58.430
<i>Another runaway, eh? 
The other day it was a prince.</i>

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.060
<i>Maybe this one's a princess.</i>

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:03.550
<i>Yeah, as if.</i>

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:08.490
But I'm actually about 
to leave town on a quest.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:11.040
Did you two just want to come along, or...?

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:11.910
Huh?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:17.970
If you're a runaway, it'll be 
harder to find you outside of town.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:21.750
Of course...

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:25.460
Hey, everyone. Do you 
mind letting us through?

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.100
Thanks!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.890
Impressive.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.710
Yes. Her skills are guaranteed.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:47.070
She is the mother of 
High Priest Skargo, after all.

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:50.010
<i>Hurry up and go through.</i>

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.090
<i>K-Keeping this position is harsh.</i>

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.470
<i>I can't bend any further.</i>

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.540
So good!

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.380
What's the matter?

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:12.050
Lonti, Mye, you're not going to eat?

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:15.550
A-Aren't you scared, Miss Cayna?

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.970
No. The forest is high elf territory.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.140
What should I be afraid of?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.060
W-Well, we weren't talking about that.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.250
Yes...

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.860
I-I've never seen a Cerberus before.

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:39.770
Oh, don't even worry. The beasts and stuff 
will stay away with Cerberwoof around.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.870
I-I see. Cerberwoof...

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:47.390
I think I'm more scared of 
Cerberus than any bea—

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:49.890
Eek! N-No, never mind!

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:51.610
Go on, eat.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.200
Th-Thank you for the food.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.430
It's good!

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:01.180
By the way...

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:04.290
What quest are you doing, Miss Cayna?

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.970
I'm hunting some horned bears.

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:07.310
Oh, I see.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:09.060
Wait.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.110
You're hunting horned bears?!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:16.280
Apparently a place called Inaba's Rabbit 
or something wanted some horned bear meat.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:18.450
Inaba's Rabbit?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.080
I've never heard of it.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:23.590
Do you mean The White-Tailed Black Rabbit?

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:24.430
Oh.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:27.460
Yeah, that's it! It was something like that.

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:30.420
And I'm stuffed!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.880
Okay, I'm gonna go get ready.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.340
What?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.770
Cerberwoof, make sure you 
watch over those two.

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:39.930
What is she getting ready for?

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.640
I honestly have no idea 
what Miss Cayna is thinking.

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:48.560
What was that?

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.400
I-I'm not sure!

00:09:58.310 --> 00:09:59.810
Miss Cayna!

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.240
Did something happen?

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:05.960
Yup. Just the right temperature.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:10.250
Hey, ready for bath time?

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.210
Huh?

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.590
B-Bath time?

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:15.520
Come on, it's going to get cold.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.690
B-But...

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.470
M-Mye?

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:24.350
Let's not waste this opportunity, Lonti.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:27.160
Huh? What?!

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:35.120
I see. So you used explosion magic 
to open a hole in the ground,

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:38.360
rearranged the stones from the riverbank 
into bricks and stacked them together,

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:43.510
then drew water from the river
 and warmed it with magic.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:45.290
Pretty much.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:50.710
Y-You make it sound so easy, but most 
people wouldn't be able to do this.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:54.310
It's no surprise that you're 
High Priest Skargo's mother.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:57.880
You know Skargo, Mye?

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:02.100
Wh-Why, yes! I see him sometimes when I go

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:04.300
visit the church.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:09.470
Don't tell me Skargo tried to put 
his mitts on you when you visited.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:10.860
Wh-What?!

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:13.250
Huh?! Wait, did he, Mye?!

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.750
Master Skargo?

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:17.120
I guess I'll need to discipline 
him when I get home.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.150
Y-Y-You've got the wrong idea!

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.150
He just gives me advice shometimes!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:33.610
Oho, Mye... Looks like you've 
got the hots for my boy.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.130
Huh?!

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.680
Guess I'm right.

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:37.920
Wait, really?!

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:41.840
First, he gives you gentle guidance 
after you ask for advice,

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:46.100
then his sweet words hit you right in the 
heart as you're entranced by his beauty.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:48.920
Oh, to be young!

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:52.230
I-I can't believe Mye is reacting like this.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:54.530
So you must have lied to me when

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:58.070
we were talking about relationships before 
and you said there wasn't anyone you liked!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:03.530
Well, how in the world am I even 
s-supposed to say something like that?

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:08.120
Then you should've said something to the 
queen before any betrothal talks happ—

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.300
Shh! Shh!

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:15.170
Ah, so you really are a princess.

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:17.590
Oh, no! She found out!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:21.630
I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry, 
I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry!

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:24.570
Falling in love isn't a bad thing.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:27.200
Actually, it's pretty important.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:32.480
I-Is it? Um, do you have any 
objections if we start a courtship?

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.520
Courtship?!

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:38.110
I mean! I have absolutely no plans 
to start one! Not in the least!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.440
I'm definitely not going to get in your way.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:42.940
Skargo's all grown up.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:44.820
I-I see...

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:50.370
Not to mention, Mai-Mai has two kids in 
Helshper and is on husband number two!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.250
My kids are free to do whatever they want.

00:12:54.590 --> 00:13:00.150
"If you want my daughter's heart, 
then you'll have to defeat me first!"

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:03.130
Man, I wish I could've said that!

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:09.950
<i>No one in this world could 
defeat this mother.</i>

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:14.350
Looks like the "baring our bodies and 
souls" mission has been compweted.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:31.450
Come on, you two. 
It's totally safe. Come on over.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.740
S-Safe?

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.210
W-We won't be eaten?

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:42.700
I'm the one who summoned this white dragon. 
It's completely obedient to me.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.040
Paw.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:48.450
Now the other paw.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:52.580
Heel.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.780
Watch closely, now.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:13:59.770
Now, beg!

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.280
Watch...

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.530
...closely?

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:08.360
See?

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.830
Y-Yes...

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.780
We definitely saw.

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:19.460
See? Isn't he nice and soft?

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.800
Y-Yes.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.380
Very.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:25.460
Was this your first time seeing one?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.090
O-Of course it was!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:31.800
Of course! Other than my father's, at least!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.080
Your father?

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.210
A-And my little brother's...

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:38.640
Well, I mean I guess they are beasts.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.480
B-Bea—?!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.400
Dragons.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:43.820
Dragons?

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:44.900
Huh?

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:50.050
Y-Y-Y-Yes, of course! Dragons! 
I'd only heard tales of them before.

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:52.410
M-Me, too.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.580
Tales?

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:56.860
The knight leader told me about them once.

00:14:56.860 --> 00:15:02.030
He mentioned there was a dragon protecting 
some ancient ruins he had visited before.

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:04.500
That's what I heard, too.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.670
Has this knight leader 
been around for a while?

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:14.850
He only took the position a few years 
ago, so I'm not sure of his age,

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.500
but he's a dragoid.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:19.020
Huh... Is he strong?

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:23.350
He is. He can easily split a stone in two!

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.690
Oh?

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:29.890
Do you get to go outside like this 
often when you're at the Academy?

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.820
Not exactly.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:36.780
We do collect medicinal herbs and hunt 
small critters from time to time,

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.620
but we usually return the same day.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.910
Do you get to go, Mye?

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:44.540
As long as I have a bodyguard, yes.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.880
I see. That must be rough.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:51.970
I consider myself lucky for even 
being able to attend the Academy.

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.880
I see.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:55.910
Oh, yeah.

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:59.560
Lonti, is Primo escaping much lately?

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.130
Primo?

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:03.130
She means the prince.

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.690
She does?

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.640
On the day that the prince escaped,

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:10.110
we happened to run into 
Miss Cayna, and she caught him.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:15.070
She overheard me almost say 
"Prince," and that's how...

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.570
...she got "Primo"?

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.060
Yes.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:24.080
I can walk on walls and on water. 
There's nothing I can't catch!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.500
I would've loved to see that.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.250
Do you think I can learn to do that?

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:32.450
Well, walking on water is one thing,

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:36.550
but walking on walls is a 
personally-crafted spell, so probably not.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:41.590
Uh, M-Miss Cayna? Please stop 
luring Mye down the wrong path!

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.210
Wrong path?

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:46.300
I'm not sure if I can teach you.

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:48.750
But if you want to learn, 
you'll have to undergo a trial.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:49.770
A trial?

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:54.950
You mean like... fight and defeat you?

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:57.960
Yeah, that's never happening.

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.370
Right...

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.380
Hup! Hi-yah!

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:20.180
Heh. There I go, kicking something 
so insignificant again.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:25.520
A-Are you all right, Mye? Hang in there!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.800
I-It usually takes a handful of knights

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.950
to even have a chance at 
defeating a horned bear.

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.780
Yet she defeated it so easily!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.930
Well, this is Miss Cayna we're talking about!

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.180
Right...

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.700
How does this not shock you, Lonti?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.760
I-I think I just got tired of being surprised.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.620
I see what you mean.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:48.360
<b>Item Box</b>

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.360
<b>Horned Bear</b>

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:48.360
There we go.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:52.570
Now if we just deliver this to That Rabbit 
Off Yonder, this quest is complete!

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:54.920
<i>You mean The White-Tailed Black Rabbit.</i>

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.420
They call it that sometimes, too.

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:59.350
All right. Let's head back to town.

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:06.850
Collecting ores and bodyguard duty?

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.280
The rewards sorta suck.

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:12.980
Aren't there more thrilling quests anywhere?

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:19.190
<i>The young lady who went hunting horned 
bears should be coming back soon.</i>

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.450
<i>I guess it wouldn't hurt to ask her.</i>

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:27.660
<i>I tried using Search, 
but I couldn't see her status or level.</i>

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:31.800
<i>Even if I'm wrong, she'll just 
treat me like some weirdo.</i>

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:33.900
<i>All right.</i>

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.670
Pardon us.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.600
Welcome to the Adventurers' Guild, sir.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.830
How may I help you today?

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:50.660
I'm searching for someone.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:56.690
Do you know anything?

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.450
Sh-Shining Saber?

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:03.370
What? Indeed, I am Shining Saber.

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.790
From the Silver Moon Horsemen Guild!

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:10.210
What?! You know of the 
Silver Moon Horsemen Guild?

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:14.190
From the VRMMORPG, <i>Leadale</i>!

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:24.980
Let's do this, Cohral!

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:26.890
Right behind you, Shining Saber!

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:31.310
Sub-Leader! It's you!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.610
Wait, are you Cohral?!

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:38.960
After they shut down <i>Leadale</i>...

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:43.630
Before I knew it, I ended up in this world.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.700
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:50.950
<i>Am I inside </i>Leadale<i>? Ow!</i>

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.240
<i>This isn't a dream!</i>

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.510
<i>Uh, hey. Hello?</i>

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:03.430
<i>I don't see the admin, my guild members,
 or anyone else. What is this?</i>

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:06.350
<i>What the hell is going on?</i>

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.800
I survived as an adventurer,

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:13.260
and this is the first time 
I've run into someone I know!

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.580
Ten years... That long?

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.620
It's only been about three years for me,

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:21.440
but this is the first time I've 
run into someone I know, too.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.100
Sub-Leader!

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:25.160
Cohral!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.790
This is great!

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:43.090
Yeah, I definitely made 
something else entirely.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:46.760
I really wanted to recreate 
what she made, but...

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.220
These should've been the right ingredients, too.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:12.280
Guess I'll start all over again.

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:23.630
Wh-What the?!
